SUMMARY:Impromptu SM 2026 CBC 54M-East Shady Maple start
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nBe Safe\, Have Fun\, and 
 Ride Together\nRide leader: CP Weaver\nRide Sweep: (volunteer to sweep)\nA
 nticipated Average Pace: 14-16 mph\nRoute: https://ridewithgps.com/routes/
 56031231?privacy_code=WymdrqQFYIEjmCQnrd9dI6HDJC5Q641w\n\nPark on the Banq
 uet side of shady maple smorgasbord.\n\nThis ride is to preview the cbc ro
 ute\, we will ride or drive over to fireside cafe for lunch afterwards.\nh
 ttps://www.firesidecafe.net/\n\nThis ride is a social ride\, but cyclists 
 are not expected to stay in one group. Cyclists may pedal at their own com
 fortable paces. Please be supportive of the other cyclists to avoid anyone
  biking alone or being dropped off the back of the last group. We will sto
 p to regroup as needed.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring
  water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflato
 r). To eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Cl
 ub membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup doe
 s not mean you are a club member. Join here Member Signup\nYour RSVP is yo
 ur agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: Code of Conduct\nGuid
 ance if an incident occurs: Incident Actions
