SUMMARY:Impromptu: Advanced B Ride (16-18 Mph)LC Muggles Meander (22F)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide leader: Vern Wheeler
 \nSweep: Volunteer to Sweep!\nAnticipated Average Pace: (16-18 mph)\nRoute
 : [LC Muggles Meander (22F) - Lancaster Bike Club](https://routes.lancaste
 rbikeclub.net/cue/lc-muggles-meander-22f/)\n\nThis is an Advanced B ride. 
 We will be keeping a B+ pace for this ride. The ride leader will ride at t
 he advertised average speed or the pace of the group. This is intended to 
 be a group ride with a no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader will
  do his/her best to keep the group together with occasional regroupings.\n
 \nPlease do not join this ride if you are not willing to ride with the gro
 up. If you exceed the posted pace\, you will be riding by yourself and enc
 ouraged to join a faster group. If maintaining a 16-18 mph average is beyo
 nd your current ability level\, please consider joining a slower ride firs
 t.\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repa
 ir kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\nTo eliminate passi
 ng around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meet
 up RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a c
 lub member. Join here [Member Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/co
 ntent.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abid
 e by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/conten
 t.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\nGuidance if an inciden
 t occurs: [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?pa
 ge_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
