SUMMARY:FreeOnFriday?   Oregon Dairy Ice Cream Ride 27R
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRIDE LEADER: Jan Zerfoss\
 , average pace \\~13 mph.\nCue and Ride with GPS link: [Oregon Dairy Ice C
 ream Ride](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/ecm-oregon-dairy-ice-c
 ream-ride-27r/)\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride Together**\n\nThis is a c
 asual ride and the ride leader will ride at the advertised pace. Some ride
 rs may ride faster than the leader so we'll likely break into one or more 
 smaller groups with stops to regroup periodically. Please stay with other 
 riders in your pace group so everyone has someone to ride with and nobody 
 is riding solo. Usually no designated sweep but nobody will get dropped.\n
 \nIMPORTANT NOTE: We will start this ride at about mile 2 of the route rat
 her than the original location indicated on the cue. This is a new start l
 ocation for us.\n\nThere are public bathrooms at the start location that a
 re usually open.\n\nPost-ride coffee/refreshments -[Scratch Bakes](http://
 www.scratchbakes.com) 32 W Main St.\, Ephrata.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. N
 o earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire le
 vers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper 
 waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this
  ride. Being on\nMeetup does not mean you are a club member. Join here [Me
 mber Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&clu
 b_id=257148)\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of
  Conduct: [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx
 ?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n\nGuidance if an incident oc
 curs: [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_i
 d=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3158477
